        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Yayeli muka Heberi aca ahitana urumambo rw’ihema n’inyundo, yinjira bukebuke, yinjira aho Sisera yari aryamye asinziriye cane kuko yari yarushe. Aca amushinga rwa rumambo rw’ihema mu mutwe, ararushimangira gushika hasi, Sisera aca arapfa.",
          "type": "text",
