          "text": "Baraki ashitse ariko arakurikira Sisera, Yayeli aramutegera, amubwira ati: “Ingo ndakwereke uwo uriko urarondera.” Aca yinjirana na we aho Sisera yari aryamye, na rwa rumambo rw’ihema rushinze mu mutwe, yapfuye.",
